<title>HUNGARY: Goldsun 96 loss rises to 894 mln forints.</title>
<headline>Goldsun 96 loss rises to 894 mln forints.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating result	     636.0 loss vs    327.5 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result		 893.9 loss vs    553.5 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales		    1,427.0	vs  2,401.0</p>
<p>    Other revenue		  105.7	vs    210.8</p>
<p>    Direct cost of sales     1,403.9	vs  1,999.4</p>
<p>    Indirect cost of sales     426.7	vs    551.2</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   338.0	vs    388.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 148.8 loss vs    224.0 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    2.4	vs	6.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure    151.1	vs    230.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Goldsun is a frozen food manufacturer that has been in liquidation since November 29, 1996.</p>
<p>The figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom+36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
